[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://vehicles/vehicle_tune.gd" id="1_tune"]

; The ordinary car (and later the patrol car), P1-020: the KEEP tune of the old game (decisions.md) retuned to GAME.md
; "Movement and camera feel": top speed about 140 km/h, 0 to 100 km/h in 10 to 12 s, 100 to 0 in 38 to 45 m. Strong
; low gears (it holds 38 km/h at full lock and climbs a 6 percent ramp at 100), a short fade at the top of each gear so
; the last gear pins the top speed.
